@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
    BorderColor #2C5282
}

title Machine d'etats de connexion - ReliablePost

state "CONN_CLOSED" as CLOSED #FFE4E1
state "CONN_SYN_SENT" as SYN_SENT #FFFACD
state "CONN_SYN_RECEIVED" as SYN_RECEIVED #FFFACD
state "CONN_ESTABLISHED" as ESTABLISHED #90EE90
state "CONN_CLOSE_WAIT" as CLOSE_WAIT #FFB6C1
state "CONN_CLOSING" as CLOSING #FFB6C1
state "CONN_TERMINATED" as TERMINATED #D3D3D3

[*] --> CLOSED

CLOSED --> SYN_SENT : Connect()\n[envoie SYN]

SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED : Recu SYN\n[envoie SYN-ACK]\n(ouverture simultanee)
SYN_SENT --> SYN_SENT : Timeout\n[retransmit SYN]
SYN_SENT --> CLOSED : Max retries atteint

SYN_RECEIVED --> ESTABLISHED : Recu SYN-ACK

CLOSED --> SYN_RECEIVED : Recu SYN\n[envoie SYN-ACK]
SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED : Recu SYN-ACK\n[envoie SYN-ACK]

ESTABLISHED --> CLOSE_WAIT : Recu CLOSE\n(peer initie fermeture)
ESTABLISHED --> CLOSING : Close()\n[envoie CLOSE]\n(on initie fermeture)

CLOSE_WAIT --> TERMINATED : Close()\n[envoie CLOSE-ACK]

CLOSING --> TERMINATED : Recu CLOSE-ACK
CLOSING --> TERMINATED : Recu CLOSE\n[envoie CLOSE-ACK]\n(fermeture simultanee)
CLOSING --> CLOSING : Timeout\n[retransmit CLOSE]
CLOSING --> TERMINATED : Max retries atteint

TERMINATED --> [*]

note right of ESTABLISHED
  Etat nominal :
  - Envoi/reception de donnees
  - ACK automatique
end note

note right of SYN_SENT
  Handshake TCP-like :
  - Machine A envoie SYN
  - Machine B repond SYN-ACK
  - Connection etablie
end note

note bottom of CLOSE_WAIT
  Fermeture gracieuse :
  - Le peer a demande la fermeture
  - On finit d envoyer nos donnees
  - Puis on envoie CLOSE-ACK
end note

@enduml
